      <description><![CDATA[
            <div class="content-box" id="content">
                <style>     div[type]{-webkit-border-radius: 4pt; border-radius: 4pt;overflow:hidden;}     div[type] img{ -webkit-border-radius: 4pt;border-radius: 4pt;}     p{font-family:'苹方','PingFang','\82f95b9','微软雅黑','Microsoft YaHei','XinGothic-SinaWeibo', helvetica, arial, sans-serif;} 	.initFade{ 	    -webkit-transition:opacity 1s; 	    -o-transition:opacity 1s; 	    transition:opacity 1s; 		opacity:0; 	}     .jijin{margin-top: 1.222em !important;padding-bottom: 0.333em;}.jijin_img{display: block;}h3+p{line-height: 12px !important;padding: 4px !important;margin: 0 !important;overflow: visible;}h3+p span{height: 1.72em;line-height: 1.72em;top: 0;}style+p{margin-top: 1.139em;}style+div[type*='GIF'],style+div[type*='IMG']{margin-top: 1.222em !important;}div + div[type*='GIF'], div + div[type*='IMG']{margin-top: 1.778em !important;}div[type*='GIF']{margin: -0.111em auto 0 !important;} div[type*='IMG']{margin: -0.111em auto 0 !important;} body,p{text-align: justify;line-height: 1.72em !important;} p{word-wrap: break-word;overflow:hidden;max-width:100%;word-break: normal !important;margin: 1.44em 0;}.img-info{font-size:0.8333em;line-height:1.53333em!important;text-align:left;color:#999;margin:1.0666em 0 -0.29833em;}   .sub-tlt{position:relative;font-weight: bold;text-indent:0.7777em;}   .sub-tlt:before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;top:0.86em;width:0.333em;height:0.333em;background:#333;-webkit-transform:translateY(-50%);transform:translateY(-50%)}.img-info + div[type*='GIF'],.img-info + div[type*='IMG']{margin: 1.777em auto 0 !important;}</style><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260627/202606272338558093_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260627/202606272338558093_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260627/202606272338558093_720.jpg"> </div><p><strong>【世界杯战报】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-29/match1867441date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">进16强！加拿大1-0南非将战荷兰摩洛哥胜者 欧斯塔基奥92分钟绝杀</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260629/zhanbao_image_1867441_1782680385_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260629/zhanbao_image_1867441_1782680385_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260629/zhanbao_image_1867441_1782680385_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>欧斯塔基奥补时绝杀！加拿大首进世界杯16强，威廉斯5次扑救难救主，加拿大将战荷兰vs摩洛哥胜者。</p><p><strong>【世界杯动态】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-29/6a417ec17ae3enative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">创造历史！加拿大队史首次晋级世界杯16强，将战荷兰/摩洛哥胜者</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260629/6a418bdea4975.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260629/6a418bdea4975.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260629/6a418bdea4975.jpg"> </div><p>美加墨世界杯1/16决赛，加拿大补时绝杀，1-0淘汰南非，成功晋级世界杯16强！1/8决赛加拿大将对阵荷兰vs摩洛哥之间的胜者。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-28/6a40e066a8e20native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">耻辱出局！官方：韩国主帅洪明甫下课，本届世界杯带队止步小组赛</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.56" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260628/202606281651021202.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.56" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.56" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260628/202606281651021202.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260628/202606281651021202.jpg"> </div><p>官方消息，韩国主帅洪明甫主动宣布辞职，本届世界杯韩国队1胜2负积3分，小组出局，最终排名第34创造韩国队史世界杯最差成绩。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-29/6a41987078f98native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">安帅战日本赛前：正像决赛一样备战这场比赛 内马尔能上场15分钟</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260629/6a419b6e5e69c_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260629/6a419b6e5e69c.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260629/6a419b6e5e69c.jpg"> </div><p>巴西国家队主帅安切洛蒂出席1/16决赛对阵日本的赛前发布会，表示球队已做好应对淘汰赛一切情况的准备，并透露内马尔可能出场15分钟。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-29/6a418893b745enative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">森保一：目标世界杯夺冠，虽然可能会被嘲笑，但这次我们是认真的</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260629/6a418fde6cd16_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260629/6a418fde6cd16.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260629/6a418fde6cd16.jpg"> </div><p>1/16决赛巴西vs日本赛前，面对将日本队称为“下狗（弱势一方）”，并询问他将如何以弱者的姿态迎战强敌巴西时，森保一做出了回答。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-29/6a41478c3b318native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">官方：乌加特膝盖韧带损伤，仍在评估伤情以确定最佳治疗方案</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.19" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260629/202606290017106872.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.19" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.19" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260629/202606290017106872_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260629/202606290017106872_720.jpg"> </div><p>曼联俱乐部与乌拉圭国家队官方消息，乌加特膝盖韧带损伤。目前正对伤情进行评估，以确定最佳治疗方案。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-29/6a41489baaa6bnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">若定罪最高判20年！FIFA回应佛得角队长强奸指控：已和当局联系</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260629/6a414c508d6a7.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260629/6a414c508d6a7.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260629/6a414c508d6a7.jpg"> </div><p>巴西媒体《环球体育》报道，佛得角队长莱恩·门德斯因一名巴西女性的强奸指控，国际足联如今就此事做出了回应。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-29/6a4173eb2b406native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">更衣室震怒！世体：西班牙全队群情激愤，痛批乌拉圭粗野犯规</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.78" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260627/202606270959453068.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.78" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.78" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260627/202606270959453068.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260627/202606270959453068.jpg"> </div><p>世体报道，对阵乌拉圭赛后，西班牙队更衣室内群情激愤。其实怒火在绿茵场上就已点燃，多名球员围住美国籍主裁伊斯梅尔·埃尔法斯，抗议乌拉圭队动作粗野。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-29/6a419c9a96eabnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">C罗安慰罗德里戈：要有耐心，一切都会好起来的，祝你好运</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.69" data="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260629/202606290701475745.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.69" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.69" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260629/202606290701475745.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260629/202606290701475745.jpg"> </div><p>葡萄牙0-0哥伦比亚，C罗首发出战全场。本场比赛因伤缺席巴西世界杯大名单的皇马前锋罗德里戈到现场观赛，赛后二人相遇C罗对他表示安慰。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-29/6a415def9cd19native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">成韩网集火对象！安贞焕维护韩国队：球迷就算了，不懂的人别乱说</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.74" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260629/202606290220359094.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.74" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.74" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260629/202606290220359094_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260629/202606290220359094_720.jpg"> </div><p>韩国不敌南非赛后的一段时间里，韩国队招致了本国球迷铺天盖地的讨伐，前韩国国脚、现评论员安贞焕因为一段维护球队、批评球迷的言论而成为了集火对象，后续他在节目中道歉，但也进行了辩解。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-29/6a41a40e310adnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">优雅告别！FIFA官方社媒晒照，约旦队在更衣室留下礼物和感谢信</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260629/202606290646024597.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260629/202606290646024597.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260629/202606290646024597.jpg"> </div><p>约旦1-3不敌阿根廷，结束了世界杯之旅。国际足联官方社媒晒出照片，约旦队像之前的比赛一样打扫更衣室，并留下了礼物和感谢信。</p><p><strong>【其他新闻】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu